---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About Ballguide"
  description="Who runs Ballguide, how its bowling gear reviews work, and how the site earns money."
>
  <article class="about">
    <h1>About Ballguide</h1>

    <p>
      Ballguide compares bowling gear in one place: what each product is, how
      it differs from the others, and what reviewers say about it.
    </p>

    <h2>Who's behind it</h2>
    <p>
      I've bowled for 40 years and I average 200 to 210. A typlical high average league bowler.
      I drill my own equipment, so i'm able to experiment with different layouts and fittings.
      I wear Hammer Power Diesel shoes and have also worn Dexter shoes.
    </p>

    <h2>How the reviews work</h2>
    <p>
      Every product is marked one of two ways. <strong>Tested by me</strong>
      means I've used it myself, and the notes are my own. <strong>Based on
      other reviewers</strong> means I haven't used it, so I summarize what
      other reviewers found and link to their reviews so you can read them in
      full.
    </p>

    <h2>How the site earns money</h2>
    <p>
      Some links are affiliate links. If you buy through one, I may earn a
      commission at no extra cost to you. It doesn't change what I write about
      a product, and I'm not paid by any brand to feature it.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.25rem 0;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
